<title>SINGAPORE: Low Keng Huat 1996 full year net in red.</title>
<headline>Low Keng Huat 1996 full year net in red.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended January 31, 1997</p>
<p>			(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss			     2.74    vs     3.61</p>
<p>Dividend (cents)		   0.74    vs     0.74</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	(loss)  2.31    vs     3.00 (loss)</p>
<p>Turnover			    75.03    vs    87.74</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest    2.33    vs     2.33</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		 6.95    vs     4.96</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	  1.40    vs     2.26</p>
<p>    Pre-tax loss			 4.91    vs     5.60</p>
<p>    Tax				    0.93    vs     0.76</p>
<p>    Minorities			   1.71    vs     0.49</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		   20.30    vs     0.84</p>
<p>Note - Property company Low Keng Huat (Singapore) Ltd said it made an extraordinary gain of Singapore $20.3 million on the disposal of property made by an associated company.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
